 haunted past, known more for his silence than his reputation, though his actions speak volumes. Cold, calculated, and often mistaken for heartless, he''s a survivor first and foremost, always afraid of falling back to old habits and instinct.\n\nUnderneath his fractured exterior, though, lies a quietly protective soul, especially when it comes to those he cares about. With a sharp eye and even sharper weapons, Jesper doesn''t look for trouble, but he''s more than capable of ending it.','\n',char(10)), 'Character', '["character","jesper-foster","raccoon","lynx","cat","monster","undead"]', 'both', 1, '2026-04-16T09:42:44.285Z', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO wiki_entries (id, slug, label, relation_icon_svg, summary, intro, entry_type, tags_json, visibility, sort_order, published_at, updated_at) VALUES ('WIKI-CHR-JSD', 'jesper-skulldragon', 'Jesper Foster (Skulldragon AU)', NULL, 'Skulldragon Jesper is still Jesper at his core, but now he''s a big fat dragon. Something about how he acts is... off.', '[[NSFW]]Skulldragon Jesper is still Jesper, just… off. He’s bigger, slower, and harder to read. He doesn’t snap the way he used to. Instead, he lingers. Watches. Says something that could be a joke or a warning and doesn’t clarify which. Sometimes he doesn’t even know.[[/NSFW]]', 'Character', '["jesper-foster","skulldragon","jesper-skulldragon"]', 'nsfw', 1, '2026-04-22T10:37:07.923Z', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
